{"4055050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abracablabla", "steam_appid": 4055050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOICE-POWERED SPELLCASTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Abracablabla</strong>, your voice is magic. Speak spells out loud to unleash chaos: call down meteor storms, conjure divine shields, polymorph enemies, or even swap bodies with allies. Your voice is your weapon, your shield, and your greatest source of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/4fee907906a3892ac5a657571d650b5e.poster.avif?t=1788288093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/4fee907906a3892ac5a657571d650b5e.webm?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/4fee907906a3892ac5a657571d650b5e.mp4?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAGIC SPARES NO ONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic doesn’t care who it hits. Your fire burns enemies and friends alike. Polymorph might turn your teammate into a sheep. A tiny mob can suddenly become a gigantic boss. And that ticking bomb might end up… attached to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos isn’t a bug — it’s the strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/15085786d24e95c00cf271c5b6f5f787.poster.avif?t=1788288093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/15085786d24e95c00cf271c5b6f5f787.webm?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/15085786d24e95c00cf271c5b6f5f787.mp4?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN FROM THE CORRUPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relentless wall of death is closing in behind you, while endless monsters wait ahead. How long can you survive when danger is coming from both sides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/6236b06db3bab469664d260f6e66c65a.poster.avif?t=1788288093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/6236b06db3bab469664d260f6e66c65a.webm?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/6236b06db3bab469664d260f6e66c65a.mp4?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEROES DEFINE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero changes the rules. The Necromancer grows stronger by killing allies, while the Paladin suffers when casting dark magic. Experiment with hero and spell synergies, build unexpected combinations, and discover the wildest strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/451f482b72a1842b0adbca3a45377471.poster.avif?t=1788288093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/451f482b72a1842b0adbca3a45377471.webm?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/451f482b72a1842b0adbca3a45377471.mp4?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOICE-POWERED SPELLCASTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Abracablabla</strong>, your voice is magic. Speak spells out loud to unleash chaos: call down meteor storms, conjure divine shields, polymorph enemies, or even swap bodies with allies. Your voice is your weapon, your shield, and your greatest source of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/4fee907906a3892ac5a657571d650b5e.poster.avif?t=1788288093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/4fee907906a3892ac5a657571d650b5e.webm?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/4fee907906a3892ac5a657571d650b5e.mp4?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAGIC SPARES NO ONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic doesn’t care who it hits. Your fire burns enemies and friends alike. Polymorph might turn your teammate into a sheep. A tiny mob can suddenly become a gigantic boss. And that ticking bomb might end up… attached to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos isn’t a bug — it’s the strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/15085786d24e95c00cf271c5b6f5f787.poster.avif?t=1788288093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/15085786d24e95c00cf271c5b6f5f787.webm?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/15085786d24e95c00cf271c5b6f5f787.mp4?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN FROM THE CORRUPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relentless wall of death is closing in behind you, while endless monsters wait ahead. How long can you survive when danger is coming from both sides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/6236b06db3bab469664d260f6e66c65a.poster.avif?t=1788288093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/6236b06db3bab469664d260f6e66c65a.webm?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/6236b06db3bab469664d260f6e66c65a.mp4?t=1788288093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEROES DEFINE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero changes the rules. The Necromancer grows stronger by killing allies, while the Paladin suffers when casting dark magic. Experiment with hero and spell synergies, build unexpected combinations, and discover the wildest strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055050/extras/451f482b72a1842b0adbca3a45377471.poster.avif?t=1